     "keyText": "Based in: Aventura Bay Harbor Coral Gables Premium Esthetic Dentistry Premium Esthetic Dentistry We combine advanced science with an artist\u2019s touch. Designing smiles that are as healthy as they are beautiful Your smile, effortlessly enhanced Implant Restoration Advanced Esthetic Restorative Dentistry",
